[Music]  get ready to dive into the battlefield  and for honor master the medieval  weaponry as the bold Knights brutal  Vikings and lethal samurai prepare for  vicious fast-paced melee combat and  become the ultimate warrior but which of  the three legendary factions will you  choose here's what you need to know to  win glory as the Vikings brought to you  by for honor the Vikings are masters of  the sea they returned in great numbers a  few centuries ago from far across the  sea after fleeing their crumbling  homelands their goal is to reclaim their  ancient homeland valcon high when this  nation of Viking clans gathers in  massive armadas of dragon headed ships  they are nearly unstoppable in joining  the war born Vikings you select from  heroes that are relentless warriors that  have no fear of death they welcome it as  their destiny and intend to bring as  many foes with them as they can you get  the chance to wield two-handed axes a  massive sword or dual axes Master the  Vikings in order to defeat the nights  and the samurai Raiders are relentless  warriors that are easy to use for  beginning players they wield heavy  two-handed axes dealing high damage and  disabling attacks the Brutes of the  battlefield Raiders intimidate their  opponents with heavy swing damaging  attacks and the health to stay in battle  longer than most heavy characters just a  few swings will knock any light to  medium hero out and give other heavy  heroes a run for their money  unfortunately Raiders biggest weakness  is their heavy swing attacks can be  blocked and/or dodged with ease by great  defensive characters or light off and  space characters Raiders combo in with  other heroes or finishing off weekend  foes makes them a nightmare on the field  the Raiders monstrous day naps can crack  enemy skulls in half under their might  warlords dedicate their lives to the  service of the people they are great  mid-level counter attackers slow and  strong they hit hard and sustained a lot  of damage armed with the Gladius and  shield if you like playing as a support  character the Warlord's are perfect for  backing up teammates with balanced  attack and defensive abilities with the  Warlord's shield you can block most  incoming attacks due to the Warlord's  slightly slow attacks and medium damage  it can be a bit tricky landing finishing  rooms however when teamed up with other  heroes in a mosh pit of chaos the  warlord will come out on top the warlord  can also be an effective attacker  against the samurai shego ki will fall  to the might of your sword and shield  berserkers are intimidating Viking  engines of death and is the hardest to  master of the Viking subclasses thus far  they combine close combat at infinite  chain attacks these dual axe wielding  maniacs are excellent in harassing enemy  heroes with quick abilities and the  damage to back it up the berserkers are  a fun subclass to use in for honor as  their speed allows them to dodge and  block quickly however they can go down  fast if hit with just a few heavy  attacks especially from a conqueror  always dodge and time your attacks  wisely since light heroes tire out  faster than other heroes the Knights  will meet their match thanks to the  berserkers war cry to battle and furious  attacks from his twin axes stay on the  move with light attacks followed by  finishing heavy attacks once in a while  and you will be a force to reckon with  on the battlefield  soon we will learn about the newest  subclass of the Vikings the Valkyries  pledge your sword to the war born Viking  clans and join the war of the factions  be sure to check out our other videos to  learn about the other factions nights  and Samurai brought to you by for honor  for honor is available februari 14 2017  and for all your for honor needs stick  with gamespot

